  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the proposed project is to improve access to finance for small and medium scale enterprises and, simultaneously, to improve participating banks&apos; capacity for SME lending. Borrower-executed PHRD grant for US$469,500 approved 3/27/00. The project cost includes an estimated $1 million donor-funded TA contract.  Donor funds are currently being searched. This amount is included in the Borrowers contribution until the donor has been identified.</narrative>
  </description>
